OtaNix ry organized a workshop on the topic of PGP and YubiKeys on NixOS. Pizza, drinks and snacks
were offered to participants.

The OtaNix ry board had prepared a presentation:
- #link("/assets/events/nix-workshop-2026-08-10/intro-slides.pdf")[Intro slides] by Luukas
- #link("/assets/events/nix-workshop-2026-08-10/pgp.pdf")[PGP + YubiKey presentation] by Luukas and Niklas

The source code and assets for the presentations are available in #link("https://github.com/OtaNix-ry/workshop")[this GitHub repository].

